# Simple hand-written cube

# Object name
o Cube

# List of geometric vertices, with (x, y, z) coordinates

#      v8---------v7
#     /.         /|
#    / .        / |
#   v4---------v3 |    y
#   |  v5 . . .|. v6    |  . Z
#   | .        | /      | .
#   |.         |/       |.
#   v1---------v2       .----- x
#

# Front plane (Z = 0)
v 0.0 0.0 0.0 # v1 - Bottom-front-left
v 1.0 0.0 0.0 # v2 - Bottom-front-right
v 1.0 1.0 0.0 # v3 - Top-front-right
v 0.0 1.0 0.0 # v4 - Top-front-left

# Back plane (Z = 1)
v 0.0 0.0 1.0 # v5 - Bottom-back-left
v 1.0 0.0 1.0 # v6 - Bottom-back-right
v 1.0 1.0 1.0 # v7 - Top-back-right
v 0.0 1.0 1.0 # v8 - Top-back-left

# List of faces

# Front    Back     Left     Right    Top      Bottom
# v4---v3  v8---v7  v4---v8  v3---v7  v8---v7  v5---v6
# |   / |  |   / |  |   / |  |   / |  |   / |  |   / |
# |  /  |  |  /  |  |  /  |  |  /  |  |  /  |  |  /  |
# | /   |  | /   |  | /   |  | /   |  | /   |  | /   |
# v1---v2  v5---v6  v1---v5  v2---v6  v4---v3  v1---v2

# Front
f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
# Back
f 5 7 6
f 5 8 7
# Left
f 1 5 8
f 1 8 4
# Right
f 2 6 7
f 2 7 3
# Top
f 4 3 7
f 4 7 8
# Bottom
f 1 6 2
f 1 5 6
